
label scene41:
    scene bg lunar tarmac
    show linda neutral at center
    show usagi postgrad worried at left2, flip
    # > 41       EXT. CROWN MILITARY ACADEMY, TARMAC                                      41
    linda "Well... have you got everything?"
    usagi "Yeah... but where ARE they? If they’re late, we have to wait 15 days just to catch the next one to Earth!"
    show linda smile
    linda "A small price to pay for the kind of peace we’ve been seeing. It’s almost like everyone knew the Crown’s rule was... fake."
    show usagi postgrad happy 1
    ### page 83 ###
    usagi "Well, Aunt Liz did say you guys had been talking about it since your school days."
    linda @ happy "And long before then. Good riddance to the Ultima Cannon. To the Crown. The fake domes. It’s a new world..."
    show sanders postgrad neutral at right2, fx.ease_xoffset(dur=1.0, x0=800) behind usagi, linda
    show takeshi postgrad neutral at right, fx.ease_xoffset(dur=1.0, x0=800) behind usagi, linda
    show usagi postgrad neutral
    show linda at flip
    usagi "There you guys are! You’re late!"
    sanders "Sorry about that. This guy was taking forever."
    takeshi "I have to make sure that I have enough film to capture everything we see on our first Earth road trip!"
    sanders "Well, let’s go, we don’t want to miss the shuttle. Mrs. Kitadani, do you need help with that bag?"
    linda "I’m perfectly fine George, thank you. Go on ahead to your seats."
    # > George and Takeshi go ahead.
    show sanders at fx.ease_xoffset(dur=2, x1=-1500)
    show takeshi at fx.ease_xoffset(dur=2, x1=-1500)
    show linda worried at noflip
    show usagi postgrad worried
    linda "Usagi, I want you to enjoy this trip. It has been a few weeks since that day... but something still isn’t sitting right with you. I can tell it."
    usagi "Mom... I... I’m still feeling.... I should have done more, something else. Professor Jojo... Barthandelus...."
    show linda neutral at noflip
    linda "None of that is on you, little rabbit. That’s how the world is. And you did so much to save it."
    show usagi postgrad neutral
    linda "When a cosmic being came to kill us all... you befriended it. You showed it kindness... you did something that only you know how to do."
    linda "I think about your father... how he tried to fight it with the violence that the crown taught us..."
    # > (MORE)
    ### page 84 ###
    show usagi postgrad happy 1
    show linda smile
    linda "That it taught your generation, that it taught everyone before for countless generations... But it was your way that worked. Even I tried to step in for your father... I was the better ace, remember?"
    usagi @ smug "You never let anyone forget."
    show linda happy
    linda "You got jokes. The point is, Usagi, that when the rest of the world thought that their way was the right way, you came along and proved everyone wrong."
    show linda smile
    linda "You changed things. You bucked the system. You challenged violence."
    linda "We set out to save the world, but it turns out the world’s greatest threat is a kid who calls me mom."
    show usagi postgrad happy 2
    show linda happy 2
    pause 0.5
    scene bg black with dissolve
    # > END
    # > 
    # > SONG: INTO THE NEW WORLD (from Kirby)    # > 
    # > End credits role with images of Usagi, Sanders, Takeshi and
    # > Linda on vacation on Earth, catching up with all of the old
    # > characters.
